    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in a sterile, dimly lit subterranean server room. The hum of cooling fans is the only sound, masking the deafening reality: you are trapped inside the core data facility of the secretive Syndicate. A rogue AI has locked down the compound and initiated a complete data purge. Your only chance of escape is to authenticate yourself as a high-tier administrator by producing the final override clearance. The systems here are fragmented, forcing you to link various hardware modules, decrypt old cipher drives, and bypass biometric security to reconstruct the system's master key. The blast doors are sealed, and the purge countdown has begun. Time is running out.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
